cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
title: "adv_lab_pcs: spectrometer dashboard and lab-PC setup for the advanced physics lab"
abstract: >-
  A local web application that turns an Ocean Optics classic-series USB
  spectrometer into a browser-based teaching instrument (live view, N-scan
  statistics with standard errors, per-channel intensity histograms, CSV export
  and an HTTP API for student scripts), plus scripts that prepare Windows lab
  PCs for the device. Developed for the advanced lab courses at the Institute
  of Physics, University of Freiburg.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ulrich
    family-names: Warring
    affiliation: "Institute of Physics, University of Freiburg"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/uwarring82/adv_lab_pcs"
version: 0.3.1
date-released: "2026-10-02"
keywords:
  - spectroscopy
  - physics education
  - laboratory instrumentation
  - Ocean Optics
  - python-seabreeze
  - FastAPI
